  "description": "The new Express is a fantastic entry into exploring road cycling, be it the daily commute or mile munching at the weekend. It’s sleek aluminium frame has internal cable routing and comes with a lifetime guarantee. Gearing is taken care of by Shimano and features STI shifters for smooth and effortless gear changes. A 7 speed cassette matches to a 50/34t compact front chainset for a wide range of gears that make hills and flats a joy.\nBraking comes in the form of dual pivot road calipers that offer reliable and proven performance. The rims have machined surfaces to ensure the brakes work well in all weathers, with the wheels being wrapped in 28c Kenda tyres. These both increase comfort and grip, a real benefit for road cycling. The Express makes road cycling available to all.",
